      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Kamatera VPS Review 2026: 14 Datacenters + 30-Day Free Trial</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg mb-6">Kamatera is one of the longest-running independent cloud providers, operating since 1995 with 14 datacenters globally, a 30-day free trial that requires no credit card, and a fully customizable pricing calculator instead of fixed plans. We tested Kamatera across CPU, storage, network, and EU data-residency scenarios to see how it compares to RackNerd, Vultr, DigitalOcean, and Linode in 2026.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10">Kamatera</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10">Customizable Cloud</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10">EU Hosting</span>
