      <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">Kamatera is one of the few independent cloud providers that combines 30 years of operation, 14 datacenters (6 EU), a 30-day free trial with no credit card, and fully customizable server configurations. It is the right choice for EU businesses needing GDPR compliance, projects that require dedicated CPU, and users who want to evaluate before paying. For users wanting simpler fixed plans at $1.99/mo, <a href="https://my.racknerd.com/aff.php?aff=16299" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-orange-400 hover:text-orange-300">RackNerd</a> is the alternative.</p>
